{"sym":"SEPL.L","v":2,"about":{"summary":"Seplat Energy Plc, an independent energy company, engages in the oil and gas exploration and production, and gas processing activities in Africa, Asia, Europe, and the Americas. It operates through two segments, Oil and Gas. The company explores, develops, and produces crude oil; and processes and produces gas. It also operates oil and gas assets. In addition, the company is involved in the provision of technical, liaison, and administrative support services relating to oil and gas exploration and production. Seplat Energy Plc was formerly known as Seplat Petroleum Development Company Plc and changed its name to Seplat Energy Plc in May 2021. The company was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Lagos, Nigeria.","lead":"Seplat Energy Plc, an independent energy company, engages in the oil and gas exploration and production, and gas processing activities in Africa, Asia, Europe, and the Americas. It operates through two segments, Oil and Gas.","web":"https://www.seplatenergy.com","emp":1506,"city":"Lagos","country":"Nigeria"},"officers":[{"n":"Ms. Eleanor Adaralegbe","t":"CFO & Executive Director","pay":1248300,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Samson Chibogwu Ezugworie","t":"COO & Executive Director","pay":1320000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Engineer Effiong Okon FNSE","t":"CEO & Executive Director","pay":574680,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. James Alexander Thompson","t":"Head of Investor Relations","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Edith Onwuchekwa","t":"Company Secretary & Director of Legal","fy":2025},{"n":"Dr. Chioma Nwachuku Afe","t":"Director of External Affairs and Social Performance & Sustainability","age":61,"yb":1964,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Ikponmwosa Ogunmwonyi","t":"Managing Director of Offshore","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Ibi-Ada Itotoi","t":"Managing Director of Onshore","fy":2025}],"own":{"ins":32.76,"inst":12.68,"inst_float":18.86,"inst_n":18},"funds":[{"n":"Aegis Funds-Aegis Value Fund","pct":0.48,"pos":2867800,"val":22627000,"chg":100.0,"d":"2026-07-31"},